From: slwyts <slwyts@foxmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: dt-bindings: media: describe the Piano video endpoint properties

Carry the shared endpoint properties used by the Piano media bindings.

Link: https://github.com/blu-sharky/linux-piano/commit/352508459733d3e6d349ea5581a8dd2fd8bb4180
Link: https://github.com/slwyts/Project-SunUEFI/commit/e8fcf33971263f28085dbc0dbe5039438bf76c13
---
 .../bindings/media/video-interface-devices.yaml      | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/video-interface-devices.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/video-interface-devices.yaml
index a81d2a155fe668a95e0916c99e702de8b5c07005..8d892996d8c08bab8ea9a4196d661731755d88eb 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/video-interface-devices.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/video-interface-devices.yaml
@@ -25,6 +25,18 @@ properties:
     enum:
       - privacy
 
+  privacy-led-brightness:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32-array
+    minItems: 2
+    maxItems: 2
+    description: |
+      Indicator brightness as a numerator and full-scale denominator. Both
+      values must be nonzero and the numerator must not exceed the denominator.
+      The consumer scales this fraction to the LED provider's real range.
+      Consumers sharing a physical indicator must request identical levels.
+      If absent, the provider's maximum is used. This is a SunUEFI proposed
+      extension, not an existing upstream binding.
+
   lens-focus:
     $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/phandle
     description:
